       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>This is the first column of the doc-ument. In this document we take ad-vantage only of the simplest featuresof the rotpages.sty package, i.e. weonly use the basic
     <Code xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>\rotboxpages
     </Code>
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>and
     <Code xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>\endrotboxpages
     </Code>
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>commands.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>The first columns are typeset nor-mally. To fill them a little, we includethe first part of
     <Em xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf2/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>Pinocchio
     </Em>
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>by Carlo Col-lodi.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>CHAPTER 1
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>
     <Em xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf2/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>How it happened that Mastro Cherry,carpenter, found a piece of wood thatwept and laughed like a child
     </Em>
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>Centuries ago there lived —
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>"A king!" my little readers will say im-mediately.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>No, children, you are mistaken. Onceupon a time there was a piece of wood.It was not an expensive piece of wood.Far from it. Just a common block offirewood, one of those thick, solid logsthat are put on the fire in winter to makecold rooms cozy and warm.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>I do not know how this really hap-pened, yet the fact remains that one fineday this piece of wood found itself inthe shop of an old carpenter. His real
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>name was Mastro Antonio, but everyonecalled him Mastro Cherry, for the tip ofhis nose was so round and red and shinythat it looked like a ripe cherry.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>As soon as he saw that piece ofwood, Mastro Cherry was filled with joy.Rubbing his hands together happily, hemumbled half to himself:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>"This has come in the nick of time. Ishall use it to make the leg of a table."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>He grasped the hatchet quickly to peeloff the bark and shape the wood. Butas he was about to give it the first blow,he stood still with arm uplifted, for hehad heard a wee, little voice say in abeseeching tone: "Please be careful! Donot hit me so hard!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>What a look of surprise shone on Mas-tro Cherry’s face! His funny face becamestill funnier.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>He turned frightened eyes about theroom to find out where that wee, lit-tle voice had come from and he saw noone! He looked under the bench–no one!He peeped inside the closet–no one! Hesearched among the shavings– no one!He opened the door to look up and downthe street–and still no one!
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>"Oh, I see!" he then said, laughing
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>and scratching his Wig. "It can easilybe seen that I only thought I heard thetiny voice say the words! Well, well–towork once more."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>He struck a most solemn blow uponthe piece of wood.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>"Oh, oh! You hurt!" cried the samefar-away little voice.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>Mastro Cherry grew dumb, his eyespopped out of his head, his mouthopened wide, and his tongue hung downon his chin.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>As soon as he regained the use of hissenses, he said, trembling and stutteringfrom fright:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>"Where did that voice come from,when there is no one around? Might itbe that this piece of wood has learned toweep and cry like a child? I can hardlybelieve it. Here it is–a piece of commonfirewood, good only to burn in the stove,the same as any other. Yet– might some-one be hidden in it? If so, the worse forhim. I’ll fix him!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>With these words, he grabbed the logwith both hands and started to knock itabout unmercifully. He threw it to thefloor, against the walls of the room, andeven up to the ceiling.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>He listened for the tiny voice to moanand cry. He waited two minutes–nothing; five minutes–nothing; tenminutes–nothing.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>"Oh, I see," he said, trying bravelyto laugh and ruffling up his wig with hishand. "It can easily be seen I only imag-ined I heard the tiny voice! Well, well–towork once more!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>The poor fellow was scared half todeath, so he tried to sing a gay song in
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>order to gain courage.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>He set aside the hatchet and pickedup the plane to make the wood smoothand even, but as he drew it to and fro,he heard the same tiny voice. This timeit giggled as it spoke:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>"Stop it! Oh, stop it! Ha, ha, ha! Youtickle my stomach."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>This time poor Mastro Cherry fell asif shot. When he opened his eyes, hefound himself sitting on the floor.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>His face had changed; fright hadturned even the tip of his nose from redto deepest purple.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>Note that the next columns are upsidedown.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Here come the rotated columns.Note that while formattingthe document, this column is
     <Em xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf2/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>deferred
     </Em>
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>, until all the block ofrotated columns is processed. Inthis way, this column is printedas the last one of the block.However, if the printed work isread upside down, this columncorrectly appears as the first ofthe block.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Obviously, also this columncontains the continuation of thenovel:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>CHAPTER 2
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
     <Em xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf2/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Mastro Cherry gives the pieceof wood to his friend Geppetto,who takes it to make himself aMarionette that will dance, fence,and turn somersaults
     </Em>
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>In that very instant, a loudknock sounded on the door."Come in," said the carpenter,not having an atom of strengthleft with which to stand up.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>At the words, the door openedand a dapper little old man camein. His name was Geppetto, butto the boys of the neighborhoodhe was Polendina
     <footnotemark xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
        rolemaps-to="Lbl"
        referenced-as="2"
       >
       <?References objects="1" ?>
      <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
      <text-fragment xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
         xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
         Layout:TextPosition="Sup"
         rolemaps-to="Span"
        >
       <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>1
      </text-fragment>
      <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
     </footnotemark>
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
     <footnote xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
        rolemaps-to="FENote"
        referenced-as="1"
       >
       <?References objects="2" ?>
      <footnotelabel xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
         rolemaps-to="Lbl"
        >
       <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
       <text-fragment xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
          xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
          Layout:TextPosition="Sup"
          rolemaps-to="Span"
         >
        <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>1
       </text-fragment>
       <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
      </footnotelabel>
      <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
         rolemaps-to="Part"
        >
       <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
          xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
          Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
          rolemaps-to="P"
         >
        <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
        <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
        <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Corneal mush
        <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>
       </text-block>
      </semantic-para>
     </footnote>
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>, on account ofthe wig he always wore which wasjust the color of yellow corn.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Here we make a small break inthe story. Please, take a second toobserve how the column content
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>is rotated, while the page head-ers and footers, comprising thepage number, are printed with thestandard orientation. Take also aquick look at the footnote and ob-serve that it is in the right place.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>Note also that in order to intro-duce a frame, the rotated columnsare slightly smaller (i.e. they con-tain a little less text than the nor-mal ones.)
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>After this informative bit, it istime for some more Pinocchio:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>Geppetto had a very bad tem-per. Woe to the one who calledhim Polendina! He became aswild as a beast and no one couldsoothe him.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Good day, Mastro Antonio,"said Geppetto. "What are you do-ing on the floor?"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"I am teaching the ants their AB C’s."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Good luck to you!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"What brought you here, friendGeppetto?"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"My legs. And it may flat-ter you to know, Mastro Antonio,that I have come to you to beg fora favor."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Here I am, at your service,"answered the carpenter, raisinghimself on to his knees.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"This morning a fine idea cameto me."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Let’s hear it."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"I thought of making myself abeautiful wooden Marionette. It
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>must be wonderful, one that willbe able to dance, fence, and turnsomersaults. With it I intend togo around the world, to earn mycrust of bread and cup of wine.What do you think of it?"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Bravo, Polendina!" cried thesame tiny voice which came fromno one knew where.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>On hearing himself calledPolendina, Mastro Geppettoturned the color of a red pepperand, facing the carpenter, said tohim angrily:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Why do you insult me?"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Who is insulting you?"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"You called me Polendina."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"I did not."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"I suppose you think _I_ did!Yet I KNOW it was you."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"No!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Yes!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"No!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Yes!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>And growing angrier each mo-ment, they went from wordsto blows, and finally began toscratch and bite and slap eachother.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>When the fight was over, Mas-tro Antonio had Geppetto’s yel-low wig in his hands and Geppettofound the carpenter’s curly wig inhis mouth.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"Give me back my wig!"shouted Mastro Antonio in asurly voice.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>"You return mine and we’ll be
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>friends."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>The two little old men, eachwith his own wig back on his ownhead, shook hands and swore tobe good friends for the rest oftheir lives.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Well then, Mastro Geppetto,"said the carpenter, to show hebore him no ill will, "what is ityou want?"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"I want a piece of wood to makea Marionette. Will you give it tome?"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>Mastro Antonio, very glad in-deed, went immediately to hisbench to get the piece of woodwhich had frightened him somuch. But as he was about to giveit to his friend, with a violent jerkit slipped out of his hands and hitagainst poor Geppetto’s thin legs.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Ah! Is this the gentle way,Mastro Antonio, in which youmake your gifts? You have mademe almost lame!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"I swear to you I did not do it!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"It was _I_, of course!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"It’s the fault of this piece ofwood."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"You’re right; but rememberyou were the one to throw it atmy legs."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"I did not throw it!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Liar!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Geppetto, do not insult me orI shall call you Polendina."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Idiot."
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Polendina!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Donkey!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Polendina!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Ugly monkey!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Polendina!"
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>On hearing himself calledPolendina for the third time,Geppetto lost his head with rageand threw himself upon the car-penter. Then and there they gaveeach other a sound thrashing.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>After this fight, Mastro Anto-nio had two more scratches onhis nose, and Geppetto had twobuttons missing from his coat.Thus having settled their ac-counts, they shook hands andswore to be good friends for therest of their lives.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>Then Geppetto took the finepiece of wood, thanked MastroAntonio, and limped away towardhome.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>"Donkey!""Polendina!""Ugly monkey!""Polendina!"On hearing himself calledPolendina for the third time,Geppetto lost his head with rageand threw himself upon the car-penter. Then and there they gaveeach other a sound thrashing.After this fight, Mastro Anto-nio had two more scratches onhis nose, and Geppetto had twobuttons missing from his coat.Thus having settled their ac-counts, they shook hands andswore to be good friends for therest of their lives.Then Geppetto took the finepiece of wood, thanked MastroAntonio, and limped away towardhome.
    </text-block>
